  "solution": "Given:\n\n72 - 4(40 + 24 ÷ 8 × 6 - 4 × 4) + 20\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9dc39efa9ed4f0e8f3a13804d9cd35a57480c17ba618ddcb102c34a0474acd66.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n72 - 4(40 + 24 ÷ 8 × 6 - 4 × 4) + 20\n\n⇒ 72 - 4(40 + 3 × 6 - 4 × 4) + 20\n\n⇒ 72 - 4(40 + 18 - 16) + 20\n\n⇒ 72 - 4 × 42 + 20\n\n⇒ 72 - 168 + 20\n\n⇒ (-76)\n\n∴ The simplified value is (-76).",
